tps://mailchi.mp/2c1a2558634f/httpsyourpersonaltrainingukthinkificcomcoursesyour-pt-business-skills" class="" target="_blank"><strong>here</strong></a>.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Want to know more?</strong></p><p>Your Personal Training hold Quarterly Discovery Webinars. These are an excellent way to learn about how Your Personal Training can help your PT career as well as being an excellent opportunity to ask questions. To find out more about these webinars please click <a href="mailto:sean.cooper@yourpersonaltraininguk.co.uk?subject=YPT Discovery Webinar &body=I am interested in the quarterly YPT Discovery Webinar, please can you send me further information." class=""><strong>here&nbsp;</strong></a></p><p><br></p><p><i>Please note that Study Active is offering its graduates the above opportunities in good faith via a partner organisation. Anyone entering their details to pursue the opportunities do so at their own will and in accordance with the partner organisation's data policy and terms.</i></p></div></div></div></div></div></div><!--gfsplit--><div class="element-wrap" id="e-1529524867098" data-label="Heading" data-icon="gpicon-heading" data-id="1529524867098"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-sm" data-exc=""><h3>Our Courses come with a secured Your Personal Training Interview&nbsp;</h3></div></div><!--gfsplit--><script>window.__gemStoreData = {};window.__gemStoreData.gemKeyValid = {};window.__gemStoreData.gemKeyValid.bestWayAddToCart = 1;</script></div><div id="divContentBk"></div><!--End_Gem_Page_Main_Editor-->
